    <guid isPermaLink="false">6694b81c37236c546e36a3fb</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 15 Jul 2024 05:48:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期音乐：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>The Velvet Underground,Nico - Sunday Morning</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>The Velvet Underground,Nico - I'll Be Your Mirror</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>The Rolling Stones - Brown Sugar</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Led Zeppelin - Down by the Seaside (1993 Remaster)</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Jethro Tull - Bourée</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Spiritualized - Ladies and gentlemen we are &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;floating in space</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Pink Floyd - Another Brick In The Wall (Part 2) &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(Live)</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>1、TheVelvet Underground - The Velvet Underground &amp; Nico (1967)</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fstxlp_OtC-NZvGYbzcIlrL3YOBK.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi5FDdpdIfTWWqQ5WZtAYM-1kOdl.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>2、The Rolling Stones - Sticky Fingers(1971)</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsewIbq6fvlsziNaT58Hb7166z9v.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmTeH-0RKne4u7qtEow3sIRUPAyU.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FohWeYHAoUrjUWSjlnaQiBtDaJ44.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>西班牙等国家的替换封面▲</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsGfrZA2F93YZLxyAD8Qq14rNjmY.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>3、Led Zeppelin - Physical Graffiti (1975)</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgXDPtSbIPK1VMj8nQc7UsvxK0Sv.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtxA4rkoXLN0jEnY8eMhcnZtCUdC.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqXRp5Xmi2W3SI00gtOkna5XlZz4.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>4、Jethro Tull - Stand Up (1969)</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmUm8VG-0lUgg-6O7Hmd-INEJLdf.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgW1LY792AOh2vmFefEKziKPiUHL.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiIODImTUjdNtwt6E77ah2inno3d.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>5、Spiritualized - &nbsp;Ladies and Gentlemen We Are Floating in Space (1997)</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuledibxY2QV0u1zFklhpUbk3Gr_.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkAihFWJE6e_O0O789Am1vfvec9e.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvAgjq8yCh0yXfpfRfJbX2zoQgCq.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnltdJ0zuDdZ6xMbxWZBH5aJrULU.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoWsl6EB9OIRsDx-EAkhUxRenxLU.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>6、PinkFloyd - &nbsp;Pulse (1995)</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjlUIr1JuZ903fDhpDNeqWFCML4L.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpHWneDvO6AlwrO0fFMuzCLBHIWE.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmUzAdg1doMxEG7v9AZtIWphvA1j.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljnBK291EpM744do9VkYZ9lJA5j9.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>另一个版本也是有LED灯的▲</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsJV1LvCWPfAHVp5_WL_UazTo4hN.png"></figure>]]></description>
