  <item>
    <title>S1 Ep03. 原来车载音响系统还有这些趣事！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6659b27d94977a26ef47ddc6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6659b27d94977a26ef47ddc6</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 31 May 2024 11:20:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期内容资料：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Highway Hi-Fi：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvfRi3T3zrx_OkFhykjl_TUTNPoc.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Norelco Auto Mignon：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnKSSQsvzU_chUERvA77d54nKkFp.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>MECA比赛中，拉斐尔·卡彭（Rafael Capone）是一个突出的获奖者。在音质联赛（Sound Quality League，简称SQL）类别中获得了多个MECA世界冠军头衔。他的2005年悍马H2，称为“灵魂庇护所H2”：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl2s38w4XZxPygaLg1MTfoQrsWng.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjhS1PZSS22D2H7g5K8Aa-YwcImo.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg3D4dE9kMTPfwSafrLS6CVROVtH.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>丹麦的奥尔胡斯市，创作型歌手马兹·朗格（Mads Langer）举办的汽车音乐会：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlsBjFfZesU3RL4hNJ-vTNcmN2nA.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlbLcY4B2z386s0wlNHX10b0TPWa.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuVeAZMib27EbyH89J9SmqJxcUir.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>（这个双闪的场景应该是韩国的汽车音乐会，音频中有误。）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期背景音乐：Jay Frog - Jaguar (Original Mix)</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrM4jg9-9KzCCsdbP6ndeprmB-f9.m4a" length="8399921" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:11:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpGb_5elrv77SQxQo4lCIugokdGj.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
