  <item>
    <title>S1 Ep01. 有多少音乐风格已经退流行？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65fea7101519139e4f1a9cb3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65fea7101519139e4f1a9cb3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 23 Mar 2024 09:55:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>（本期收音有几秒片段产生电流声，敬请谅解）</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期来聊聊那些退流行的音乐风格。</span></p><span></span><p><span>不知道你们有没有一些喜欢听的音乐风格但在现在是比较少人听的？像我就很喜欢听Big Beat，不过现在听的人不多，所以在节目中给大家聊了聊Big Beat。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Big Beat的代表性艺术家：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>The Chemical Brothers（化学兄弟）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Fatboy Slim（流线胖男孩）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>The Prodigy（神童乐队）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>还有其他被大家淡忘的音乐风格：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Eurodance（欧陆舞曲）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Grunge（垃圾摇滚）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Tribal House（部落浩室）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Nu Metal（新金属）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Emo Punk（情绪朋克）......</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>本期涉及音乐：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>1、Zig It Up (The Main Attraction Funke Club) - ninjaman / Flourgon</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>2、Right Here Right Now - Fatboy Slim</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>3、The Private Psychedelic Reel - The Chemical Brothers</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>4、Destroy Zeppelin L48 - Progenitor</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvihRY6UEMTnRKUdrThWQby3A6Gi.m4a" length="12751847" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:17:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpGb_5elrv77SQxQo4lCIugokdGj.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
